{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Value-Sensitive Design.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Value-Sensitive Design.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"value sensitive design value sensitive design","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Value-Sensitive Design.md","fileName":"Value-Sensitive Design.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Value-Sensitive Design","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 23:09\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[AI Governance and Responsible Innovation]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Governance and Responsible Innovation","Limits of Responsible Innovation","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Value-Sensitive Design.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Value-Sensitive Design.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"value sensitive design value sensitive design","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Value-Sensitive Design.md","fileName":"Value-Sensitive Design.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Value-Sensitive Design","heading":"Value-Sensitive Design","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Value-sensitive design is a method for identifying the human values affected by a technology and incorporating them throughout design. It examines direct and indirect stakeholders, investigates how values appear in the context, and connects those findings to technical requirements.\n\nThe method helps make apparently neutral design choices discussable, but it faces two limits. Values can conflict, and people may not be able to state all of their practical ethics as explicit rules. It also often assumes the technology will be built. [[Limits of Responsible Innovation]] arise when the ethically important question is whether development should stop.","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Governance and Responsible Innovation","Limits of Responsible Innovation","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Value-Sensitive Design.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Value-Sensitive Design.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"value sensitive design value sensitive design","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Value-Sensitive Design.md","fileName":"Value-Sensitive Design.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Value-Sensitive Design","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[aiethics.epub]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Governance and Responsible Innovation","Limits of Responsible Innovation","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}